/T (This project compared supervised and self-supervised methods for hand gesture recognition on NinaPro DB7 using sEMG and accelerometer signals. MKA-CNN achieved the best supervised performance, while BYOL was the strongest self-supervised method. The study shows that self-supervised learning can learn effective representations and is a promising direction for robust gesture recognition.)
/E (This project compared supervised and self-supervised methods for hand gesture recognition on NinaPro DB7 using sEMG and accelerometer signals. MKA-CNN achieved the best supervised performance, while BYOL was the strongest self-supervised method. The study shows that self-supervised learning can learn effective representations and is a promising direction for robust gesture recognition.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
